{"version":1,"key":"card:710","content":{"id":710,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d808bcce-2e2a-416a-be29-0c8e3528fa3c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"经济下行的时候，我们总能看到政府大搞基建：修高铁、建机场、扩公路。为什么经济越差，政府反而越要花钱？这背后的理论支撑就是乘数效应，凯恩斯主义中的一个核心概念。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1778920511084_223e6cb4-1d6f-4040-a6ec-5100d1a4cc56.webp","uuid":"947c8d6e-846f-4b20-a6bb-82979d5f5f8c","previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/input-image-1778920511084_223e6cb4-1d6f-4040-a6ec-5100d1a4cc56.webp","width":512,"tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","collabId":"2e57995a-ea29-464d-b985-c4a61a7067da","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ac968e5e-ff8b-4ac4-bbab-63d7301e70bf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它的逻辑建立在一个朴素的事实上：一个人的支出就是另一个人的收入。假设政府投资了 100 元修路，施工队拿到这 100 元后不会全部存起来，而是把其中 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"80\\%","collabId":"9745cc66-d583-4c33-a2cf-d5859639dd3d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 花出去，比如买材料、吃饭。这 80 元又变成了别人的收入，别人再把 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"80\\%","collabId":"14148af0-4490-4741-a7b6-4e35a171a26f","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 花出去，如此一轮轮传递下去。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"95aa6e9a-ff04-44e9-b13c-abdf44c58eb2","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用数学来表达这个过程，就是一个等比数列求和："}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\sum_{i=0}^{\\infty} Iq^{i} = I \\cdot \\frac{1}{1 - q}","collabId":"1de3e7e0-a1b5-4cd4-94bf-be889059fdc8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"99d616a9-610c-4279-99fe-88a221efddac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其中 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"I","collabId":"76f3275d-e251-49ab-8986-6f1c91b86450","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是初始投入，"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"q","collabId":"41896b00-2833-42a8-9dde-199a15831988","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是​"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"边际消费倾向"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，即每增加一单位收入中用于消费的比例。"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"k = \\dfrac{1}{1 - q}","collabId":"d8fb3cda-1689-46b8-ba70-6962f08287a7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是乘数。当 "},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"q = 0.8","collabId":"3be0a8e7-2881-40a4-96a1-4fcd9f541076","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":" 时，"},{"type":"inline-math","tauContract":"346edd25ec1d096575893afc0b9283d5c97b9a3d922ffaebf10ce904509beedc","tex":"k = \\dfrac{1}{1 - 0.8} = 5","collabId":"b508a5ca-50db-4758-b3d3-06ae3acc87d7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，意味着政府每投入 1 元，最终能在整个经济体中产生 5 元的国民收入。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5fe178cd-dd71-4e00-b8a8-ba4be2d86824","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这就是凯恩斯主义强调政府投资的理论基础：当企业和居民都不敢花钱的时候，政府站出来花第一笔钱，通过乘数效应层层放大，重新激活整个经济循环。"}]}],"tags":["经济/乘数效应","概念"],"createTime":1778918899287,"updateTime":1778920674650,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1778920674650}}